`main.go` references both constants. `go run scripts/generate-openapi/main.go` compiles **only** `main.go` (`command-line-arguments`), so `constants.go` (and any sibling like `collect.go`) is invisible and the build dies with `undefined: StrSpecsOpenapiYaml` / `undefined: StrSystem`. The fix is to run the whole package:

```bash
