## 3. `append_board_task_dispatched.py` — canonical compact JSON

**Bug:** `json.dump(s)` / `json.dumps(s)` defaults to `separators=(', ', ': ')`, so every write re-emitted the board with spaces, churning the canonical compact file on each run.

```python
# scripts/append_board_task_dispatched.py — before
