The pre-existing engine pieces are unchanged: `BuildDAG` (validates duplicate node IDs, dangling edges, self-loops, cycles; Kahn's algorithm with deterministic tie-breaking) and `Engine.Execute` (topological walk; each node gets `{"input": ..., <parentID>: <parentOutput>}`; returns outputs keyed by node ID).

